  "description": "Grofil, a Graffiti Font, is perfect for anyone looking for a bold, Throw-Up Style font. It blends hand-drawn, spray can-inspired street art with a mix of playful, pop-like lines and wildstyle elements. This font is inspired by graffiti on walls and features easy-to-read characters with an artistic edge, making it ideal for creating eye-catching digital street graffiti typography for promotions, headlines, and more. Let your creativity shine with Grofil Font!\nGrofil is perfect for projects like promotions, book covers, fashion, skateboards, music, posters, merchandise, streetwear, and much more.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Grofil, a Graffiti Font, is perfect for anyone looking for a bold, Throw-Up Style font. It blends hand-drawn, spray can-inspired street art with a mix of playful, pop-like lines and wildstyle elements. This font is inspired by graffiti on walls and features easy-to-read characters with an artistic edge, making it ideal for creating eye-catching digital street graffiti typography for promotions, headlines, and more. Let your creativity shine with Grofil Font!</p>\n<p>Grofil is perfect for projects like promotions, book covers, fashion, skateboards, music, posters, merchandise, streetwear, and much more.</p>",
